From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] diffkv attention: split-KV decode and MTP verification for long contexts

The TRITON_ATTN_DIFFKV launcher took the split-KV 3D kernel only for
max_seqlen_q == 1, with 16 segments and one program per query token, so a c1
MTP verify step over a long context (1 + k query tokens) ran the 2D kernel: one
program per (query token, kv head) walking the whole KV prefix on a handful of
SMs. Three switches, default off (all on in profile default), full-attention
layers only (sliding-window layers read a 128-token window either way):

VLLM_MIMO26_DIFFKV_SPEC_3D=1: verify launches (1 < max_seqlen_q <= 16) whose
batch fits the preallocated segment buffers use the 3D kernel; it and its
reduction already handle partials per query token.
VLLM_MIMO26_DIFFKV_SPEC_BM=1: one program covers all 1 + k query tokens of a
sequence (BLOCK_M = GQA x next_pow2(1 + k)) so every KV tile is read once per
sequence, with 64-key tiles and the qk 192 = 128 + 64 split.
VLLM_MIMO26_DIFFKV_SEGMENTS=128: split-KV segments per sequence for
full-attention groups (DiffKV metadata builder; the shared Triton backend keeps
16). Segments past the sequence end exit early, so CUDA graph shapes are fixed.

The 2D/3D choice depends only on the batch shape, so each CUDA graph captures
one path. One global layer (64 q / 4 kv heads, qk 192, v 128), ms, 2D -> this:
c1 q=4: 55k 3.70 -> 0.34, 134k 7.25 -> 0.53, 268k 14.28 -> 0.94, 512k 27.61 ->
1.74; c1 q=2 268k 14.49 -> 0.69; c8 q=4 268k 21.78 -> 7.22, 8k 0.88 -> 0.62;
plain decode (q=1, segments only) c1 268k 2.44 -> 0.79. Error vs fp64 equal to
the 2D kernel; outputs differ at rounding level.
---
diff --git a/vllm/mimo26_opt_profile.py b/vllm/mimo26_opt_profile.py
index f6fea83..ed371aa 100644
--- a/vllm/mimo26_opt_profile.py
+++ b/vllm/mimo26_opt_profile.py
@@ -36,6 +36,13 @@ PROFILES: dict[str, dict[str, str]] = {
         # dim split 128 + 64 instead of padding to 256 (bitwise equal)
         "VLLM_MIMO26_DIFFKV_PREFILL_BM": "128",
         "VLLM_MIMO26_DIFFKV_QK_SPLIT": "1",
+        # 0011 MTP verification on full-attention layers uses split-KV (3D)
+        # attention (c1 at 55k context: 3.7 -> 0.9 ms per global layer)
+        "VLLM_MIMO26_DIFFKV_SPEC_3D": "1",
+        # one program per sequence for all 1 + k verify tokens (64-key tiles,
+        # qk split) and 128 split-KV segments on full-attention layers
+        "VLLM_MIMO26_DIFFKV_SPEC_BM": "1",
+        "VLLM_MIMO26_DIFFKV_SEGMENTS": "128",
     },
 }
 
